      "writtenOn": "2026-09-01T13:48:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it might be possible as nothing stops drawables from referencing themselves or previous drawables to form a loop. I think we\u0027ll want approximateOpCount to take a depth parameter to limit recursion. The we can stop recursion when the depth gets to SkPicturePriv::kDefaultRecursionLimit and just return 1 like we use to for that case.",
